{"id":72767,"date":"2026-11-04T08:17:04","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:17:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72767"},"modified":"2026-11-04T09:31:31","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:31:31","slug":"grande-premio-de-atletismo-acd-os-ilhavos-2","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-de-atletismo-acd-os-ilhavos-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo Acd os Ilhavos 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo Acd os Ilhavos 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo Acd os Ilhavos 2027<\/strong> (42\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>31 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, nas art\u00e9rias urbanas de <strong>\u00cdlhavo<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>, assinalando simultaneamente o <strong>Campeonato Distrital de Estrada de 5 km<\/strong> e as comemora\u00e7\u00f5es do 50\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio da hist\u00f3rica coletividade ilhavense. O programa matinal abre \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o e culmina \u00e0s <strong>11:15<\/strong> com a corrida principal junto \u00e0 sede na <strong>Avenida Senhora do Pranto<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com medi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial homologada pela <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA)<\/strong> e perfil plano prop\u00edcio a marcas r\u00e1pidas na regi\u00e3o da Ria de Aveiro, a prova principal de <strong>5 km (5.000 m)<\/strong> re\u00fane atletas juniores, seniores e veteranos. Antes da corrida absoluta, disputam-se sete provas dedicadas aos escal\u00f5es jovens \u2014 desde as Escolinhas e Benjamins (<strong>400 m e 800 m<\/strong>) at\u00e9 aos Infantis (<strong>1.600 m<\/strong>), Iniciados (<strong>2.100 m<\/strong>) e Juvenis (<strong>3.400 m<\/strong>).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva \"Os \u00cdlhavos\"<\/strong> (Institui\u00e7\u00e3o de Utilidade P\u00fablica fundada em 1977) em parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de \u00cdlhavo<\/strong> e sob ajuizamento do Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip em todos os escal\u00f5es, pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios individuais at\u00e9 ao 10\u00ba lugar da geral e balne\u00e1rios de apoio nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do clube.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida Senhora do Pranto, n\u00ba 20, \u00cdlhavo, Aveiro<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 km (Prova Principal FPA) e Provas Jovens (400 m a 3,4 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva \"Os \u00cdlhavos\" e Munic\u00edpio de \u00cdlhavo<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tipo de Piso<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Asfalto \/ Estrada Urbana<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Perfil & Relevo<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Plano e r\u00e1pido<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/s3.lap2go.com\/events\/2027\/gp-atletismo-os-ilhavos\/Regulamento-gp-atletismo-os-ilhavos-2027-min.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Juvenis Masc. e Fem. (3,4 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Escal\u00f5es Jovens (2010\u20132011):<\/strong> Gr\u00e1tis<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Iniciados Masc. e Fem. (2,1 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Escal\u00f5es Jovens (2012\u20132013):<\/strong> Gr\u00e1tis<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Infantis Masc. e Fem. (1,6 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Escal\u00f5es Jovens (2014\u20132015):<\/strong> Gr\u00e1tis<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Benjamins A\/B e Escolinhas (400 m \/ 800 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:25<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Partidas \u00e0s 10:25, 10:30, 10:35 e 10:45:<\/strong> Gr\u00e1tis<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Prova Principal 5 km (Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (Federados \/ N\u00e3o Federados):<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac \/ 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 20\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (Federados \/ N\u00e3o Federados):<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac \/ 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/01\/2027 a 27\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo Acd os Ilhavos 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 42\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Estrada ACD Os \u00cdlhavos realiza-se no domingo, 31 de janeiro de 2027, em \u00cdlhavo (junto \u00e0 sede do clube na Avenida Senhora do Pranto, n\u00ba 20), integrando o Campeonato Distrital de Estrada de 5 km da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e dist\u00e2ncias de cada escal\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas jovens arrancam \u00e0s 09:30 com os Juvenis (3.400 m), seguindo-se Iniciados \u00e0s 10:00 (2.100 m), Infantis \u00e0s 10:15 (1.600 m), Benjamins B \u00e0s 10:25 (800 m), Benjamins A \u00e0s 10:30 (400 m), Escolinhas 3\u00ba\/4\u00ba ano \u00e0s 10:35 (800 m) e Escolinhas 1\u00ba\/2\u00ba ano \u00e0s 10:45 (400 m). A Prova Principal de 5.000 m (Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos) parte \u00e0s 11:15.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para federados e n\u00e3o federados?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 27 de janeiro de 2027. Nos escal\u00f5es de Escolinhas, Benjamins, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuita. Na prova principal de 5 km, at\u00e9 20 de janeiro de 2027 o valor \u00e9 de 5,00 \u20ac para atletas federados e 8,00 \u20ac para n\u00e3o federados; de 21 a 27 de janeiro de 2027 passa para 8,00 \u20ac (federados) e 11,00 \u20ac (n\u00e3o federados).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que lembran\u00e7as, pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e servi\u00e7os de apoio est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas juniores, seniores e veteranos recebem uma T-shirt t\u00e9cnica, enquanto os escal\u00f5es jovens recebem um pin oficial do clube. H\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios at\u00e9 ao 10\u00ba lugar em Juniores\/Seniores M\/F (150 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba classificado) e aos 3 primeiros em Veteranos, al\u00e9m de banhos dispon\u00edveis nos balne\u00e1rios da ACD Os \u00cdlhavos e servi\u00e7o de bar.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza e arbitra o 42\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo ACD Os \u00cdlhavos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva \"Os \u00cdlhavos\" em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de \u00cdlhavo, contando com medi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo e arbitragem do Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo Acd os Ilhavos 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida Senhora do Pranto, n\u00ba 20, \u00cdlhavo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"\u00cdlhavo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 42\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo ACD Os \u00cdlhavos 2027 realiza-se a 31 de janeiro em \u00cdlhavo. Prova de 5 km homologada e corridas jovens. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/banner-gp-atletismo-os-ilhavos-2025-min.jpg\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Juvenis Masc. e Fem. (3,4 km)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/gp-atletismo-os-ilhavos-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Iniciados Masc. e Fem. (2,1 km)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/gp-atletismo-os-ilhavos-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Infantis Masc. e Fem. (1,6 km)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"htt